   9  *==============================================================================*
  10  *Introduction
  11  *This manual is based on the GTAP data mapping code (DATA_GTAP11b.gms). It explains the process of mapping between GTAP data and the PEP-w model, clarifying key variables and data transformation processes within the code.
  12  *
  13  *This manual can only be used for non-commercial (NC) purposes and must be shared under the same license (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0).
  14  *For detailed license information, please visit:
  15  *https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/
  16   
  17  *License Notice
  18  *This manual is based on the GTAP data mapping code (DATA_GTAP11b.gms), originally developed by Veronique Robichaud, Andre Lemelin, Helene Maisonnave, and Bernard Decaluwe. It is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0) license.
  19   
  20  *Key License Terms:
  21  *Attribution (BY): You must give appropriate credit to the original authors.
  22  *Non-Commercial (NC): This work cannot be used for commercial purposes.
  23  *Share-Alike (SA): If you modify or build upon this work, you must distribute the modified work under the same license.
  24  *For more details, please visit:
  25  *https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/
  26   
  27  *==============================================================================*
  28  * Running new GTAP Model generates a number of files, of which two are
  29  * used below: BaseData2019.har and Parameters2019.har.
  30   
  31  * The har2gdx facility allows converting these two files into GDX format.
  32  *==============================================================================
